{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16564","headline":"春雨 · 刘复","name":"春雨","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"细雨度深闺，莺愁欲嬾啼。\n如烟飞漠漠，似露湿凄凄。\n草色行看靡，花枝暮欲低。\n晓听钟鼓动，早送锦障泥。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘复","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16564.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16564","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}